<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1TIM</book>
  <para style="h">1 TEMCEO</para>
  <para style="toc1">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Temceo</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Temceo</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Tem</para>
  <para style="mt2">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo bot</para>
  <para style="mt1">TEMCEO</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Paulo ocoyo waraga man bot Temceo macalo latine i niye. Temceo onongo Lakricitayo ma pud awobi dok tek i niye ma mere. Wone obedo dano me Grik ento mine obedo Lajudaya. En obedo lawang Paulo ki lami kony madit tutwal bote ikare ma Paulo tye kawot me cwalo Kwena Maber bot Lurok.</para>
  <para style="ip">Waraga mukwongo ma Paulo ocoyo bot Temceo ojenge ikom lok adek madito. Mukwongo en oniango Temceo me gwoke ki ikom pwony me goba ma konye peke ma ocung dok ojenge ite kwaro pa Lujudaya. Pwony man ocung ma orube ki tam pa Lujudaya ki pa lurok mukene ni wilobo ki gin ducu matye iye obedo gin marac dok bene ni dano romo lare kun a ki i ngec mukane kitiyo tic macalo kwero camo kit cam mogo ki me bedo labongo nyome.</para>
  <para style="ip">Me aryo Paulo otito ki Temceo kit ma, loc, woro ki kwo pa latic me Kanica omyero obed kwede.</para>
  <para style="ip">Me adek Paulo otito ki Temceo me bedo latic pa Lubanga ma gene, ma kwiri dok ngeyo tic ki dul dano mapat pat matye i Kanica.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Mot ma oa ki bot lacoc <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Lok ma mako Kanica ki lutic iye <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma Temceo omyero otii dok okwo kwede <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Waraga man oa ki bot an Paulo ma lakwena pa Kricito Yecu pi cik pa Lubanga Lalarwa ki Yecu Kricito ma genwa ocung ikome.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Tic 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Bot Temceo latina me ada i niye. Lubanga Won ki Kricito Yecu Rwotwa omii gum, kica, ki kuc.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Juku pwony me goba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Macalo nene kong abako doga boti ikare ma acito i Makedonia, amitoni kong idong i Epeco wek icik jo mukene pe gupwony pwony mo mapat. <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />Pe bene guket cwinygi ilok me ododo ma giboko ikom kwarigi, ki lubu nying ducu ma kiryeyo pa kwarigi macon, makelo tam atata, dok pe konyo yub pa Lubanga ma ocung ikom niye. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Gin ma omiyo yam aciki ki lok man en aye ni iwek dano gubed ki mar ma dano bedo kwede ka cwinygi leng dok ma kitgi ber ma gipeke ki bal mo ikomgi, dok ma niyegi goba mo peke iye. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Jo mogo gungak woko ki ikom lok man ci gudonyo ka boko lok atata ma konye peke. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Gin gimito bedo lupwony cik pa Lubanga, ma kun bene pe giniang kadi wa lok ma giloko, nyo kadi gin ma gitye kalok ikome, ma gucung iye matek tutwali.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Wan wangeyo ni Cik ber ka dano otiyo kwede i yo ma cik mito. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Omyero kong waniang ni, cik pe kiketo pi jo ma kitgi atir, ento kiketo pi lutur cik ki pi jo ma gin pe luwiny, ki pi jo ma pe lworo Lubanga ki pi lubalo, kiketo pi jo ma pe gileng, jo ma pe keto cwinygi ikom Lubanga, pi jo ma neko won gi ki jo ma neko megigi, pi lunek dano mukene, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />dok pi jo ma timo tim kwele, jo ma butu ki co luwotgi, jo ma kwalo dano ci girwenyo kwede woko alii, lugoba, jo ma kwongo kwong labongo tere, ki kit gin mukene ducu ma pe rwate ki pwony me ada. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Meno aye pwony ma nonge ilok me Kwena Maber mayam gimiya me atita, lok maber ma tito pi deyo pa Lubanga ma kipwoyo.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pwoc pi kica pa Lubanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Amiyo pwoc bot Kricito Yecu Rwotwa en ngat ma miya teko me tiyo tic man, pien dong okwana me bedo lagen, ka dok bene oketa i tice, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Tic 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4">9:4</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 9:5">5</ref></char></note> kadi bed yam abedo kaloko lok marac ikome, ki aketo tim gero matek ikom jone wa ki kelo ayela ikome. Ento en otima kica, pien ceng atimo meno ki kwiya piny labongo niye, <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />ci kica pa Rwotwa omede tutwal ikoma kacel ki niye ki mar matye i Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="1TI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Lok man lok me ada, myero dano ducu guye ni, Kricito Yecu yam obino i lobo pi laro lubalo. Ikin lubalo an aye abedo labal maloyo ducu. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Ento en otima kica pi lok man, wek ikin lubalo, Yecu Kricito okwong nyutu diyo cwinye maberi bota macalo lanen bot jo mukene ma gibiye en, ka dong gicako nongo kwo ma pe tum. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Woro ki deyo obed nakanaka bot Rwot madit maloyo kare ducu, ma pe to, ma pe nen, en Lubanga acel kene. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Latina Temceo, amiyo boti cik man ma rwate ki lok me nebi mayam lutit lok pa Lubanga guloko ikomi, wek ka ilubu lokgi ci biweko ilweny lweny maber, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />kun nongo imako niye matek ma tam ii leng. Pi kwero tam pa jo ma ongak woko ma i igi nyutu botgi balgi ento pe gi yee lok me ada, jo mogo macalo meno dong niyegi obale woko. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Jo mogo ikin gi obedo macalo Kumenayo ki Alegijanda, yam amiyogi woko i cing Catan wek gupwonye guwek yeto Lubanga.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kit me woro i kanica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Lok mukwongo aciko in ni, bako dog, lega, lega ma kilego pi jo mukene, ki miyo pwoc, omyero kitim pi dano ducu, <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />pi luker ki jo ducu matye irwom mamalo, wek omii Lubanga okony luloc i tic gi ci wan bene wabibed mot labongo ayela, kun waworo Lubanga ma kitwa dok watiyo gin mabeco i yo ducu. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Man ber, dok Lubanga Lalarwa bene pwoyo. <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />En mito laro jo ducu, dok mito ni jo ducu gunge lok me ada. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Pien Lubanga tye acel, ngat ma ribo Lubanga ki dano bene tye acel, ma obedo dano, en aye Kricito Yecu. <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />En omine kene me bedo gin kok pi jo ducu; meno en aye caden mayam kimiyo i karene kikome. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2 Tem 1:11</ref></char></note> Pi lok man, kiketo an me bedo latit lok dok lakwena, (aloko lok ada, goba pe iye) an lapwony pa Lurok, i niye ki ilok ada.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Man aye gin ma omiyo amitoni co myero guleg Lubanga i kabedo ducu, kun gitango cinggi malo labongo kiniga nyo daa mo. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1 Pet 3:3</ref></char></note> Kitmeno, mon bene omyero guruke maber ki mwolo, kun gigwoke, pe i yer wic ma kikedo, nyo jabu, nyo tiko ngut, nyo ruk mogo me wel mamalo, <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />ento bergi myero onen i tic maber ma gitiyo, meno en gin mamite bot mon ma gilwonge ken gi ni gin jo ma woro Lubanga. <verse eid="1TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Dako myero opwonye laling ling kun bedo ki winy. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />An pe aye ni dako mo opwony dano nyo obed ki twero ikom laco; ento omyero obed oling alinga. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Aca 2:7</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21">Aca 2:21</ref>,<ref loc="GEN 2:22">22</ref></char></note> Pien Adam aye ma kikwongo cweyone, ka dong lacen kicweyo Kawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Aca 3:1-6</ref></char></note> Dok bene yam pe kibwolo Adam, ento kibwolo dako, ci omiyo en opoto i bal odoko labalo. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Kadi bed kumeno, dako kibilaro ikare me nywal, kace omede kabedo ki niye dok ki mar, kun bedo maleng ma gwoke kene.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Lutela ma i Kanica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Lok man lok me ada. Kace dano mo mito tic me bedo latela jo pa Lubanga, nongo en mito tic maber. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tit 1:6-9</ref> </char></note> Latela myero obed labongo lok mo ma kijuke iye, obed ki dako acel, ogwoke kene, obed ryek, obed dano ma kiworo. Obed dano ma gwoko welo, lapwony maber, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />ma pe lamero kongo, ma pe lakolo, ento obed dano mamwol, ma pe da atata, dok pe obed ngat ma maro lim. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />En myero obed ngat ma loyo ode maber kun gwoko lutinone miyo gibedo ki winy bot jo madito, ma giworo dano i yo ducu. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Pien kace dano mo pe loyo ode kikome maber, ci en twero gwoko lwak jo muye Lubanga ningning? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Myero pe obed dano ma pud oloke aloka nyen i niye, miyo kete malo ki wake, ci poto woko cut, lok loye macalo yam oloyo Catan. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Medo ikom meno myero en obed dano ma jo ma woko pwoyo, wek pe okel yet mo ikome ma miye poto i owic pa Catan.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lukony tic i Kanica</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Kitmeno, ludikon myero bene gubed jo maromo awora, jo ma pe doggi aryo, ma pe gin lumat kongo matek tutwal, pe gubed bene luworo me nongo lim; <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />myero bene gubed jo ma mako lok maber me mung pa Lubanga pi niyewa ma gicung iye matek, kun cwinygi bene leng. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Myero kong kikwong temogi; kace kinongo ni lok mo pe marac ikomgi ka dong kiyegi guti tic me dikon. <verse eid="1TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Mon bene kitmeno, myero gubed mon maromo awora, ma pe lucok dog dano, gubed jo ma gwoke ken gi dok jo ma lugen i jami ducu. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Ludikon myero gubed wegi mon acel acel, omyero gulo lutinogi ki odigi bene ducu maber, <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />pien ludikon ma gitiyo tic mabeco ginongo rwom maber pirgi ken gi, dok gidoko jo ma cwinygi tek ikom niye matye i Kricito Yecu.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mung madit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Atye ki gen me bino boti pi oyot, ento acoyo lok me pwony man boti, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />ka agale, ci inge kit ma myero dano obed kwede ikin jo me ot pa Lubanga, ma en aye lwak jo muye Lubanga makwo, ma en aye obedo wir ki guti me te ot matek, me ada. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Mung me dini ma watucu pire ni dit tutwal:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Yam en onyute ical pa dano,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Cwiny Maleng onyute ni en kite atir,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">lumalaika bene gunene,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">kitito pire bot lurok mapol,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">kiye lok kome iwi lobo ducu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">ka dong kitere woko ipolo malo i deyo.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lupwony ma lugoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Cwiny Maleng waco atir ni, ikare mo ianyim jo mogo bibwoto niyegi woko, gicako lubu jogi ma gin lugoba, ki pwony pa cen. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Pwony ma kitmeno a ki bot jo ma luroro ma gin lugoba, ma tam ma i igi ma nyutu botgi balgi oding woko macalo del kom dano ma kiwango ki nyonyo malyet. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />Gin jonu gijuku ni dano pe gunyom, dok bene giciko dano ni gukwer cam mogo, kun Lubanga yam oketo cam wek jo ma ye en, ma gingeyo lok me ada, gugam ki pwoc. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Pien jami ducu ma Lubanga ocweyo gibeco, pe tye mo ma myero kikwer ki ikin gi, kace onongo kigamo ki pwoc; <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />pien lok pa Lubanga ki lega lonyogi bedo maleng.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Latic pa Yecu Kricito maber</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ka iketo pwony magi inyim utmego, ci i bibedo latic pa Kricito Yecu maber, ma kipito ki lok me niye ki pwony mabeco ma ibedo kalubuneni. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Kwer lok mogo me mingo ma tere peke ma pe me lworo Lubanga. Pwonye keni i kwo me lworo Lubanga. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Pwonye me rweyo ler kom tye ki kony, ento konye nok; lworo Lubanga konyo i yo ducu, pien twero kelo botwa gum ikare man ki i kwo me kare ma bibino i anyim, macalo Lubanga yam ociko. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Lok man lok ada, myero dano ducu guye. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Meno aye gin ma omiyo wacane dok wacuke me tic matek, pien waketo genwa ikom Lubanga makwo, ma en Lalar pa jo ducu, ento makatone pa jo ma ye Yecu.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Cik lok magi dok ipwony ki dano. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Pe imii ngat mo ocayi ni pien in pud itidi, ento bed lanen maber bot jo muye, iloki, ikiti, imar, iniye, ki ibedo maleng labongo gin marac mo ikomi. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Nio ka abino, mii kare ni me kwano coc mayam kicoyo inyim lwak, kun itito lok, ki ipwonyo bene. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Pe ibwot mot me cwiny ma itye kwedeni obale nono, mayam kimii pi lok me nebi ma lutit lok pa Lubanga gutito ikare ma ludongo guketo cinggi iwi. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Nyut lok magi ki tic, ket cwinyi iye, wek dano gunen kit ma itye kawot kwede anyim. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Gwoke keni, dok igwok pwonyi bene; mak matek, pien ka itimo kumeno, in kikomi ibilare kacel ki jo ma winyi bene.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Tic bot utmege</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Pe itwak ladit mo, ento cuk cwinye macalo woru; omyero inen awobe macalo omegini, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />nen mon madongo macalo mego, ki mon matino myero inengi macalo lumegini, labongo tam mo marac.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Wor mon ma coggi oto, madong gudong ken gi. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Kace dako ma cware oto tye ki lutinone ki likwaye, myero gin kong gukwong pwonyo ticgi me dini i odigi gin kikomgi, kun gimiyo kony bot lunyodogi pi kony mogo mayam gumiyo botgi, pien meno aye Lubanga pwoyo. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Dako ma cware oto ma odong kene labongo ngat mo ma konye, keto gene ducu ikom Lubanga, dok bene bako doge kun lego Lubanga dyeceng ki dyewor. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Ento dako ma cware oto ma yenyo mere yomcwiny me kom keken, nongo dong oto kadi bed pud kwo. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Ket cik man, wek gubed labongo lok mo ma kijukugi iye. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Kace dano mo pe miyo gin mo me konyo wadine, makato pi jo me ode kikome, nongo dong okwero niyene woko, dok bene odoko rac makato ngat ma pe oye Lubanga.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Pe myero kicoo nying dako ma cware oto, macalo dato, ma mwaka me dite peya oromo pyere abicel nono. Medo ikom meno en myero obed dako mayam obedo ki laco acel keken. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Myero kinen ka tice ber, kace yam opito lutino, ka yam ojolo welo, nyo olwoko tyen jo pa Lubanga, ka okonyo jo mayam giunugi, dok bene ka obedo ngat mayam omine kene i tiyo gin maber i yo ducu. <verse eid="1TI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Ento myero ikwer coyo mon ma pud gitino ma coggi oto; pien miti me komgi twero miyo gikwero Kricito woko, gicako mito nyome doki aye, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />miyo kingolo kop loyogi pi turu cikegi mukwongo. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Medo ikom meno, giloke gidoko luwackom ma gibibedo kawot awota i ot ki ot; pe gibedo luwackom keken, ento gidoko bene jo ma loko lok atata, ma giroyo wigi igin ma pe meggi, gibedo kaloko lok ma pe myero guloki wa ki acel. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Pimeno, omiyo amito ni mon matino ma cogi oto kinyomgi wek gunywal lutino, gulo odigi, wek pe gumi kare ki lukworwa me loko gin mo marac ikomwa. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Pien jo mogo ikin gi dong gungak woko, gitye kalubu Catan. <verse eid="1TI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Kace dako mo muye Rwot tye ki wadine ma gin mon to, ci myero en omii botgi kony, wek pe kinur lwak muye Yecu ki lego kony, ento lwak muye Yecu gubed ka konyo mon ma cogi oto ma lakonygi mo peke.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Ludongo maloyo loc maber myero kiworgi tutwal, makato myero kiwor jo matye ka yele katito lok ki pwonyo dano. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: a </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Nwo 25:4</ref>; </char><char style="xo" closed="false">b </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luk 10:7</ref></char></note> Pien lok mayam kicoyo waconi, “Pe itwe dog twon ka tye ka nyono bel,” dok bene ni, “Latic myero kicule mucarane.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nwo 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> Pe iye lok adot mo ma kikelo ikom ladit mo, gwok nyo ka tye lucaden aryo nyo adek macalo ginacoya owaco. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Dong jo ma pud ocung ikom balgi, myero ijukgi inyim dano ducu, wek omii jo mukene gubed ki lworo. <verse eid="1TI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Aciki inyim Lubanga ki Kricito Yecu ki lumalaika ma ki yero, gwok cik magi ma pe ilenge ikom dano mo keken. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Dok bene pe irune me keto cingi ikom ngat mo, nyo me ribe ki jo mukene i balgi; ento gwoke ibed maleng.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Cake kombedi, dong pe imat pii keken, mat bene kongo bwino manok pi konyo ii pi two ma maki kare ki kareni.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Bal pa jo mogo nen woko kamaleng ma cimo atir ni kop biloyogi, ento bal pa jo mukene nen lacen. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Tic maber bene nen woko kamaleng; kadi pe kitmeno, pe kane matwal ma pe binen.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Jo ducu ma gin tye opii, omyero guti ki luditogi macalo jo maromo awora i yo ducu, wek ngat mo pe oyet nying Lubanga nyo pwonywa. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Jo ma luditogi dong guye Rwot, myero pe gukwer worogi, ni pien gin dong gibedo omego, ento myero gumede me tiyo tic maber makato botgi, pien jo ma gin konyogi ki ticgi gubedo jo muye Rwot dok jo ma gin maro.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="1TI 6:2">Pwony me goba ki lonyo me ada</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Pwony lok magi dok icuk cwiny dano iye. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Ka ngat mo pwonyo mere lok mapat kun pe lubu lok ada pa Rwotwa Yecu Kricito ki pwony makelo kwo me woro Lubanga, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />nongo en dong okete malo kene ki wake, ento pe ngeyo gin mo kadi wa ki acel. Nongo iye opong ki par maracu me pyem ki da ikom nyig lok mogo; dong lok macalo meno tye iye nyeko, pyem, yet ki par maracu mamiyo gen rwenyo woko ki ikin dano. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Dok bene miyo jo ma ryekogi obale, ma mako lok me ada oloyogi woko, gibedo ki pyem i lok nono, kun bene gitamo ni dini aye yo me nongo lonyo. <verse eid="1TI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Lonyo dit tutwal idini kace iyeng ki gin mo keken ma itye kwede. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Pien wan yam pe wakelo gin mo i lobo kany, dok bene pe wabitwero tero gin mo ka wa a ki i lobo. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Ento ka watye ki cam ki ginaruka, jami magi romowa gire. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Ento jo ma mito bedo lulonyo miyo Catan bitogi ci gipoto ibal ka dong gimoko i owic pa Catan pi mitigi mapol me mingo maracu ma tye ka unugi, miyo girwenyo dok gito woko matwal. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Pien maro lim en aye acaki me gin maracu ducu; man en gin ma omiyo jo mogo gua woko ki i niye, ka dong gurwate ki lwak can mapol ata mucore ikomgi.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lweny maber me niye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Ento in dano pa Lubanga, leng yo ki jami meno ducu, ket cwinyi ikit ma atir, ilworo Lubanga, ki iniye, imar, idiyo cwiny ki imwolo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Lweny lweny maber me niye; mak kwo ma pe tum matek mayam kilwongi iye ikare ma itucu niyeni inyim lucaden mapol ata. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Jon 18:37</ref></char></note> Aciki inyim Lubanga mamiyo kwo bot jo ducu, ki inyim Yecu Kricito, ma otucu niyene maber ikare ma miyo lok me cadene inyim Pontio Pilato. <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />Gwok cik ma kimiyi, bed labongo kit roc mo nyo lok mo ma kijuki iye, nio ka Rwotwa Yecu Kricito binen. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Lubanga ma kipwoyo, en acel keken aye Won Twer, en Rwot pa luker ducu, ki Rwot pa rwodi, en binyutu man ka karene kikome dong oromo. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />En Lubanga acel keken ma pe to, ma bedo i dero mo ma ngat mo pe romo nyiko cok kwede, cake con ngat mo pud pe munene, dok bene dano mo pe twero nene. Woro ki twer ma pe gik obed bote. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Cik lulonyo me kare man ni guwek wake, dok bene pe guket gen gi ikom lonyo ma pe geneni, ento guket gen gi ikom Lubanga ma miyowa jami ducu mabup ma yomo cwinywa. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Myero guti tic mabeco, gubed lulonyo itimo ber bot dano, ki ipoko jami, ki imiyo mot ki yomcwiny. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Ka gutimo meno, nongo gukano mono maber pirgi ken gi pi kare me anyim, wek gunong kwo ma en aye obedo kwo me ada.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Ai Temceo, gwok gin mayam dong kimiyo i cingi. Gwoke ki boko lok mogo ma pe me woro Lubanga, ki ipyem mogo ma a ki igin ma kilwongo gobagoba ni, “Ngec”, <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />pien jo ma giwaco ni gitye ki kit ngec meno miyo gipwayo piny nono i lok ma mako niye, kun girwenyo woko matwal ilok ma mako niye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Kica pa Lubanga obed kwedi.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>